// FMT round-trip: BUILD(FMT(x)) ≡ BUILD(x).
// User-defined names that share spellings with keywords (add) must keep their
// casing; commas must not grow a leading space (`2, 3` not `2 , 3`).
// Build: luke FMT examples/build/fmt_roundtrip.luke | luke BUILD -o …

THIS IS FUNCTION add WITH a AS NUMBER, b AS NUMBER GIVES BACK NUMBER DO
  GIVE BACK ADD a AND b
END FUNCTION

THIS IS FUNCTION mul WITH a AS NUMBER, b AS NUMBER GIVES BACK NUMBER DO
  GIVE BACK a MULTIPLY b
END FUNCTION

SPEAK "fmt_roundtrip start"
SPEAK ASK add WITH 2, 3
SPEAK ASK mul WITH 4, 5
MY NAME IS x AS NUMBER SET TO 2 ADD 3 MULTIPLY 4
SPEAK "x=" AND x
MAKE SURE x EQUALS 14
SPEAK "fmt_roundtrip_ok=1"
